+# wordstats CLI output format
+
+Default N: 5.
+
+One line per word, most frequent first (ties alphabetical, as per core.top_words):
+
+    <rank>. <word>  <count>
+
+- rank is 1-based, followed by a period and one space
+- word and count separated by exactly two spaces
+- no header, no trailing summary line
+- exit code 0 on success; 2 if the file does not exist (print `error: <path> not found` to stderr)
